Day 3 Roadmap

With workload health and data persistence completed, the next phase covers cluster ingress and automated scaling:

Ingress Controllers & Path-Based Routing: Moving beyond port-forwarding to expose multiple services using host and path rules (e.g., /api vs /web).

Horizontal Pod Autoscaling (HPA): Deploying the Kubernetes Metrics Server and configuring automated scaling based on CPU and memory thresholds.

